OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after collision
OL,4,Aoutside school
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for witnesses
OL,7,Fafter a collision outside a school in
OL,8,FSurrey that left a motorcyclist with
OL,9,Fserious injuries.
OL,11,FA black Yamaha motorcycle collided with
OL,12,Fa green Dacia outside Whyteleafe
OL,13,FPrimary School on Whyteleafe Hill at
OL,14,Faround 15:50 BST on Thursday, according
OL,15,Fto Surrey Police.
OL,17,FThe rider was taken to hospital with
OL,18,Fserious injuries.
OL,20,FOfficers are appealing for witnesses or
OL,21,Fanyone with dashcam footage to come
OL,22,Fforward.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
